          %h2#properties Properties
          %h3#coset_structure Coset structure
          %p
            The 6-sphere, as a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+manifold"} smooth manifold
            is
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/diffeomorphism"} diffeomorphic
            to the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coset+space"} coset space
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msup
                    %mi S
                    %mn 6
                  %mo ≃
                  %msub
                    %mi G
                    %mn 2
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                  %mi SU
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mn 3
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                  S^6 \simeq G_2/ SU(3)
          %p
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/G%E2%82%82"} G₂
            (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/automorphism+group"} automorphism group
            of the
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/octonions"} octonions
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/special+unitary+group"} SU(3)
            (
            %a{:href => "#FukamiIshihara55"}> Fukami-Ishihara 55
            ).
          %p
            For more see at
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/G%E2%82%82%2FSU%283%29+is+the+6-sphere"} G₂/SU(3) is the 6-sphere
          %p
            The induced
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/action"} action
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/G%E2%82%82"} G₂
